OL,3,GNEWSA'Nepo baby is a horrific term,'
OL,4,Asays Zeta-Jones
OL,5,
OL,6,FHollywood star Catherine Zeta-Jones has
OL,7,Fdeclared the phrase "nepo baby" is
OL,8,F"horrific", saying: "These kids didn't
OL,9,Fask to be born into this."
OL,11,FThe term refers to children of famous
OL,12,Fparents perceived to have achieved
OL,13,Friches and success off their parents'
OL,14,Fbacks.
OL,16,FThe 56-year-old actress, married to
OL,17,FKirk Douglas' son Michael Douglas, has
OL,18,Ftwo children - Dylan and Carys - who
OL,19,Fhave both followed their parents into
OL,20,Fshowbiz.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
