OL,3,GNEWSA'Nepo baby is a horrific term,'
OL,4,Asays Zeta-Jones
OL,5,
OL,6,FDylan, she said, was pursuing acting
OL,7,Fwhile Carys was interested in
OL,8,Fdirecting. She told The Sunday Times
OL,9,Fthey were "plugging away".
